Cain d5/d9 T-state sampling circuits are adapted from:

Madelyn Cain, Dolev Bluvstein, Chen Zhao, Shouzhen Gu, Nishad Maskara,
Marcin Kalinowski, Alexandra Geim, Aleksander Kubica, Mikhail Lukin,
and Hengyun Zhou, Data for "Fast correlated decoding of transversal
logical algorithms" (2025), https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15702016.

Source: distillation.zip, distillation/distillation_5 and distillation_9.
