https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Modifications: replace the 15 factory-input S gates and the ideal readout
ancilla's S gate with T; append observable 0 for the existing terminal
logical-X measurement. Retain all other gates, noise and detectors.
No decoder, feedforward or postselection is added. The raw readout bit
is not a decoded logical error. See workloads/generate_cain_distillation.py.
